    "description": "<p>You use the winds to guide projectiles.</p><p>Select a creature within <strong>10 spaces</strong>. It increases its <strong>Accuracy</strong> and <strong>Training</strong> in <strong>Ranged Weapons</strong> by <strong>+1</strong> until the start of your next turn.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may increase the bonus to <strong>Accuracy</strong> or <strong>Ranged Weapons</strong> by <strong>+1</strong> per extra success.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.XXx8gc9M556qVLkQ]{Favorable Winds}</p>",
